@startuml MealUp_CrossService_Overview
title MealUp - zaleznosci miedzy mikroserwisami (referencje po ID, database-per-service)

skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans"
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

' ===================== KOMPONENTY (mikroserwisy) =====================
package "Frontend (Next.js)" #FAFAFA {
    [Web App]
}

node "API Gateway\n:8000" as GW #EFEFEF

package "Auth Service :8001\n<<Redis>>" as AUTH #F5F0FF
package "User Service :8002\n<<PostgreSQL>>" as USER #EAF7EA
package "Recipe Service :8003\n<<MongoDB>>" as RECIPE #FFF6E5
package "Workout Service :8004\n<<MongoDB>>" as WORKOUT #E5F4FF
package "Analytics Service :8006\n<<MongoDB>>" as ANALYTICS #F0EAFF
package "Forum Service :8007\n<<PostgreSQL+pgvector>>" as FORUM #FFEAEA
package "Notification Service :8008\n<<Redis>>" as NOTIF #EAFBF4

database "Auth0\n(IdP, OAuth2)" as AUTH0 #FFFFFF

' ===================== PRZEPLYW ZADAN =====================
[Web App] --> GW : HTTPS / REST
GW --> AUTH : walidacja sesji / login
GW --> USER
GW --> RECIPE
GW --> WORKOUT
GW --> ANALYTICS
GW --> FORUM
GW --> NOTIF

AUTH --> AUTH0 : OAuth2 (code exchange, userinfo)
AUTH --> USER : provisioning konta (get_or_create_user)

' ===================== REFERENCJE PO ID (luzne sprzezenie) =====================
USER ..> RECIPE : recipe_ids / liked_recipes
USER ..> WORKOUT : liked_workouts (workout_id)
RECIPE ..> USER : author_id

FORUM ..> USER : author_id
FORUM ..> RECIPE : linked_recipes
FORUM ..> WORKOUT : linked_workouts

WORKOUT ..> USER : trainer_id / clients

ANALYTICS ..> RECIPE : fetch_recipe / fetch_ingredient (HTTP)
ANALYTICS ..> USER : user_id (auth0 sub)

note bottom of FORUM
  Wzorzec **database-per-service**:
  brak kluczy obcych miedzy bazami,
  spojnosc utrzymywana przez
  referencje po identyfikatorach
  oraz wywolania HTTP (httpx).
end note

@enduml
